  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Place haloumi in a medium bowl and cover with water to soak.\n• Cut sweet potato into fries.\n• Place fries on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with paprika spice blend and season with a pinch of pepper.\n• Toss to coat. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: If your tray is crowded, divide the fries across two trays!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878a80d0527cba53bf0f6/step-ee40fb00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice brown onion (see ingredients).\n• Grate beetroot. TIP: Wear gloves to avoid staining your fingers (optional).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878a80d0527cba53bf0f6/step-886ba510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a good drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add beetroot, the balsamic vinegar and brown sugar and cook, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add the water and cook, stirring occasionally, until reduced, 5-6 minutes. Season with a pinch of salt and pepper. TIP: Store any leftover beetroot relish in the fridge!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878a80d0527cba53bf0f6/step-8a22d920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the fries have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Add haloumi and cook until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• TIP: Cook haloumi in batches for best results.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878a80d0527cba53bf0f6/step-2081b530.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, halve bake-at-home burger buns and bake directly on a wire oven rack until heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878a80d0527cba53bf0f6/step-4ca9a440.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread burger buns with smokey aioli.\n• Top with the beetroot relish, mixed salad leaves and haloumi.\n• Serve with spiced sweet potato fries and any remaining smokey aioli. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f878a80d0527cba53bf0f6/step-a8bc1c50.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
